# Self-signed cert pair for the Caddy ↔ Traefik internal hop, generated
# per-deployment on the host (see deploy/traefik/README.md). Certs are
# specific to a deployment and not interesting to share — keep them out
# of the repo.
caddy-certs/
*.crt
*.key
!deploy/traefik/.gitkeep
